@NexEcosystem: "Nex-N2 is here! A family of agentic models that doesn't just think, it acts! Coding, search, tool use. All fused into a single agentic reasoning loop."

It features adaptive thinking that auto-scales reasoning depth to save tokens without performance loss, and coherent thinking across search, coding, and tool use, eliminating fragile mode-switching. The model achieves Tier-1 open-source performance on benchmarks like SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, and GDPval, tracking GPT-5.5 and Opus 4.7. It is open-weight and available for use now.
